sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor GuardA as 👮 Security Staff A
  actor GuardB as 👮 Security Staff B (Concurrent Race)
  participant Route as FastAPI Route<br/>(POST /pickups/complete)
  participant Service as PickupService
  participant UoW as MongoUnitOfWork
  participant TokenRepo as MongoPickupTokenRepository
  participant StoreRepo as MongoStorageRepository
  participant PkgRepo as MongoPackageRepository
  participant Bus as EventBus

  Note over GuardA, GuardB: Both staff attempt to hand over the SAME package simultaneously with the valid code
  par Concurrent Handover Request
    GuardA->>Route: POST /pickups/complete {pkg_code, learner_id: "LRN-1001", code: "482913"}
    Route->>Service: complete(pkg_code, learner_id, code, GuardA)
  and
    GuardB->>Route: POST /pickups/complete {pkg_code, learner_id: "LRN-1001", code: "482913"}
    Route->>Service: complete(pkg_code, learner_id, code, GuardB)
  end

  Service->>UoW: packages.get_by_internal_code(pkg_code)
  Service->>TokenRepo: get_latest_token(pkg.id)
  Service->>Service: Constant-time HMAC comparison (hmac.compare_digest)

  critical Guard A executes atomic token consumption
    Service->>TokenRepo: mark_used(token.id)
    Note over TokenRepo: find_one_and_update({_id: token.id, used_at: null, revoked_at: null}, {$set: {used_at: now}})
    TokenRepo-->>Service: SUCCESS (1 document modified)
    Service->>PkgRepo: compare_and_set_status(pkg.id, expected=PICKUP_REQUESTED, target=COLLECTED)
    PkgRepo-->>Service: SUCCESS (1 document modified)
    Service->>StoreRepo: release(pkg.storage_location_id) -> {$inc: {occupied_count: -1}}
    Service->>UoW: pickup_records.create(package_id, token_id, learner_id, GuardA.id, shelf_code)
    Service->>UoW: commit()
    Service->>Bus: publish PackageStatusChanged(COLLECTED)
    Route-->>GuardA: 201 Created {status: "COLLECTED", collected_at: now}
  option Guard B arrives milliseconds later
    Service->>TokenRepo: mark_used(token.id)
    Note over TokenRepo: find_one_and_update({_id: token.id, used_at: null, revoked_at: null})
    TokenRepo-->>Service: NONE (Token already used by Guard A!)
    Service-->>Route: 409 Conflict (PICKUP_CODE_USED / ALREADY_COLLECTED)
    Route-->>GuardB: 409 Conflict ("Package has already been collected")
  end
